<!--
The document layout wrapping every route: the shipped <SiteLayout> shell, the
head/header/sidebar/footer chrome plus the body `page` + color-scheme class. The
layout middleware transcludes each route's body in as SiteLayout's default-slot
child, so it lands in <main> with no relay here. The site adds to the `head`
slot and replaces the `header`, to title it with the logo.

The `head` slot carries the self hosted Inter the brand type names. The icons
and the web app manifest are not listed here: the shell links them from the
`<IconSet/>` `main.bsx` declares, so the links and the files cannot drift. The
social card and the brand tint ride `<PackageConfig/>` and `<Theme/>` in
`main.bsx` instead, since a crawler reads them as meta rather than links.

The font is served from our own bucket, not a CDN, so a visit costs no third
party request and the site keeps working with the rest of the web unavailable.
Without it the heaviest weights the type scale asks for are a browser's synthetic
bold, so the wordmark and every display heading would arrive at the wrong weight.

The header is the shell's own restated, its title the logo rather than the
site name. The logo is two images, the light and dark files `main.bsx`'s
`<ScriptDerivation>` draws, the page's scheme class showing one: an image
cannot see the page it sits in, so one file following the OS would miss a
scheme the visitor pinned. A terminal shows the name instead. The nav carries
the site's own links ahead of the scheme toggle and the repository link. The
Docs link is `hidden`, like the unlisted pages it leads to: they serve to
whoever holds a url, and nobody browsing the site is shown the way in.

<Analytics/> injects the page-view beacon script on every page (web only; the
runtime ignores the <script> on terminal targets, whose page views come from the
in-world navigator instead).
-->
<SiteLayout>
	<Fragment slot="head">
		<link rel="preload" href="/assets/fonts/InterVariable.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin="anonymous"/>
		<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/fonts/inter.css"/>
		<style>
			.light-scheme .beet-logo.beet-logo-dark, .dark-scheme .beet-logo.beet-logo-light { display: none; }
			.app-bar-title .beet-logo { display: block; height: 2.5rem; width: auto; }
		</style>
	</Fragment>
	<Header slot="header">
		<MenuButton slot="leading"/>
		<Fragment slot="title">
			<img class="beet-logo beet-logo-light terminal-hidden" src="/assets/logo/logo-light.svg" alt="Beet"/>
			<img class="beet-logo beet-logo-dark terminal-hidden" src="/assets/logo/logo-dark.svg" alt="Beet"/>
			<span class="terminal-only">Beet</span>
		</Fragment>
		<Link slot="nav" href="/docs" variant=ButtonVariant::Text hidden>Docs</Link>
		<Link slot="nav" href="/blog" variant=ButtonVariant::Text>Blog</Link>
		<ColorSchemeToggle slot="nav"/>
		<RepositoryLink slot="nav"/>
	</Header>
	<Analytics/>
</SiteLayout>
